{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "ee6dad9550deb08ecc8e508555f03e881eeda517d94d55aeb51639102ddca416", "ja": "はじめての『せーふく』！", "zh": "第一次的『征服』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "28a49bdfc3b4a97928af4348b1159df232d7011bcce3391910a6230f3a4a11f2", "ja": "いよいよ『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』はじ\nめての収録。そして子ども達との対面。\n元気いっぱいの子ども達に大人達は手を\n焼いてしまうが、アイドル達はそれぞれの\n特技で、子ども達と仲良しになる。", "zh": "《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》的第一次录影\n终于要开始了，偶像们也见到了孩子们。\n虽然精力充沛的小朋友让大人很伤脑筋，\n但偶像们利用各自的专长，和孩子们\n成为好朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "24f544641375240b1e435b7d83f86c30cbee390f21d7c53130d754213dd42e26", "ja": "（今日はいよいよ『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』の\n最初の収録だ！）", "zh": "（《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》\n终于要在今天进行第一次录影了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f65e168c6eaf9c027c7bb2b189ed382c3889fc802ba27818a0b830577fa9bec4", "ja": "（収録の前に、アイドル達と子ども達との\n顔合わせの場が設けられた。しかし……）", "zh": "（在录影前，我们有安排时间\n让偶像和小朋友先见面，只是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1002_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "03284b70c15e4733585d70517ed21e6d710c3a35c4f13a589eb1c11244533300", "ja": "わー！\nきゃー！", "zh": "哇──！\n呀──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3ed1473895205ffb65e80a9a5f114d4a617a55ce2c469a2bd50ab0b716df1805", "ja": "みんな落ち着いてくれ！\n俺の話を……って全然、聞いちゃいないな……。", "zh": "大家安静一点！\n听我说……唉，他们完全没在听我讲话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6cdf14cdebe595946a5bd3c2ad227d25eada25d40cf87828865da90efa3b17c4", "ja": "（元気がよすぎる。これをまとめるのは、ちょっと\n難しいんじゃないか？　ADさんも困ってるぞ……）", "zh": "（他们太有活力了，这下要带领这些小孩子，\n是不是有点困难啊？助理导播也在伤脑筋……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "4cbf724c24068cc40ccd29e9977d13325b4620db3d55449d44a3ae44962e695d", "ja": "これ……、大変、かも……。", "zh": "这下……可能会，很辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "799af63743baef66742f95d4b703838bf5239ad67b06d00a93399962e339e842", "ja": "でも、おねえさんとして、\nわたし達がなんとかしてみせます！", "zh": "不过，身为大姊姊，\n我们会想办法带领大家的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1007_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "95ff8cc57251decf5b081ab8893c4507e83591bfe16449645989738c0ba4b119", "ja": "わー！！\nきゃー！！", "zh": "哇──！！\n呀──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
