{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1010_gennkinaonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "ab5e16899e7bce8dcf8c45562734a55cfff705fad19a3635b85241d95a8d0fcb", "ja": "つかまっちゃったー！", "zh": "被抓到了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fe76a714347752abe614137531bc7d5be462f97b4874ecbd925b9ed4c14c4a71", "ja": "（さすが環！　一部の苦悩をよそに\nさっそく子ども達に混ざっちゃったな）", "zh": "（真不愧是环！她不顾我们这些人还在烦恼，\n立刻就跟孩子们打成一片。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "061859c74c51ee67778e862eda8d07add4d7ce7aa48a02f3810157c12bfeea9a", "ja": "（そしてあっちは……）", "zh": "（而另一边则是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "dd21749c26792297ba4b6daf8b0f7e947a08e6a2b931aebfb169d7501224e94f", "ja": "こんにちは！　わたし、星梨花っていうの。\nね、一緒に遊ぼう？", "zh": "你好！我叫做星梨花。\n要不要来一起玩呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1014_kiyowanaonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "9811d46d09c8e2a306625c4c2269e6906d554e945328984b65bc54d18fa7de43", "ja": "う、うん……。", "zh": "呃、嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "3817fb1304bf0f73a7fba501035fdb6ee1b4bfaf3ec6750c6de42cdadf8072b7", "ja": "あ、そうだ。ジュニオールもごあいさつしなくっちゃ。\nあのね、この子はわたしのお友達のジュニオール！", "zh": "啊，对了，朱尼奥尔也要来打声招呼。\n我跟你说，牠是我的朋友，朱尼奥尔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1016_junior", "source_sha256": "ec7054ec84aa0c9e9d76411a017d732c60c7149b897132e3c046eb83a37cfad8", "ja": "クゥーン……。", "zh": "汪呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1017_sunaonaotokonoko", "source_sha256": "fbe94e934eb3d5302a0568995baed272c13d8a257616aa0b6b1972ef55710601", "ja": "わっ、大きい犬だ！？", "zh": "哇，好大的狗喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1018_kiyowanaonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "787c2345c9e891a6c157773d29b3f330ab3e1c9efbc9ee703f4ccda90a52e595", "ja": "うう、怖いよ～！　え～ん！", "zh": "呜呜，好可怕喔～！呜哇～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "f2443907b868738b917f6a1cf719c2583442292f1ecb8a2cbae3a98e7dab6fc0", "ja": "ええっ。\nジュニオール、こわいかな……！？", "zh": "咦……\n朱尼奥尔会很可怕吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "aa5722d43e0b632640e4d15713592417033ec6d312cc56deb66b4102a7c44b6b", "ja": "だ、大丈夫。ジュニオールはこわくないよ～。\nとってもいい子なんだよ。", "zh": "没、没事的，朱尼奥尔不可怕喔～\n牠很乖喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1021_kiyowanaonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "c802d1f447f87045a2290b31d1c44569b491122d136de90d6c8a73999c5799f0", "ja": "えーんえーん！", "zh": "呜哇～呜哇～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "5e6a7eade71b887cd4fc6832c5296c8db18da412bf133735e289af9c3286c419", "ja": "ジュニオール……いい子なのに……。\n嫌われちゃったのかな……。しゅん……。", "zh": "朱尼奥尔……明明是个好孩子的说……\n牠是被讨厌了吗……好沮丧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "84f44e6a26c7696f08b0639d9068ab0e41eda6a2825d642e4fb35003de99adee", "ja": "うう、悲しくなってきちゃった……。", "zh": "呜呜，我开始难过起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "e38308de3866d483a70574a508f2c29e8296b17a2b38af5234c26b407ffeeb4e", "ja": "お～、よしよし。大丈夫かい。\nびっくりしちゃったんだねぇ。", "zh": "喔～小朋友乖～\n还好吗？你吓了一跳吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "26e98263a3c8b76b59d5714634f61575d4bf4f28f23b426d3cb071f4d6ab75df", "ja": "ジュニオールは、\n「おはよう」ってあいさつしてくれたんだべさ。", "zh": "朱尼奥尔牠啊，\n是在向你打招呼说「早安」哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "cc191fe796305ed13e9b0415e0037d8ac19b67fa587790cfecae9e806cff7c5b", "ja": "おっかないことはなんにもないからねぇ。", "zh": "牠一点都不可怕的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1027_kiyowanaonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "2087f0f564f87e0ba0d1b598d1618db7c6e050855c38ac4df184257e4d6c7f31", "ja": "そうなの……？", "zh": "是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1028_junior", "source_sha256": "ffa6922e14c3473f90d35a78c1b85ddb2c0e9347909e7252699cc1ea61c54080", "ja": "ワウン……？", "zh": "汪呜……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "7138455a0e05e63bc708fa27431a1d5877064d83a5c7a773cac9d6348617a660", "ja": "ほら、心配そうにしてるでしょや？\nジュニオールは、とってもやさしいいい子なんだぁ。", "zh": "你看，牠看起来很担心你吧。\n朱尼奥尔是个很温柔的好孩子喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1030_kiyowanaonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "ff0c5e708492c42bc5bb14052ca7ed7e9589111cfe517d77eb96c19da48db740", "ja": "そっか……。\n泣いちゃってごめんね、ジュニオール。", "zh": "是喔……\n我还哭出来了，真对不起，朱尼奥尔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1031_junior", "source_sha256": "7694666da8a12c3607db5ceb4b343e4a99ce8c4f2ff442451c3796539add114b", "ja": "クゥン……♪", "zh": "汪呜……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "1be8fc49562094ddf723c2627be04222c41b5e254b807220764336954185ebd2", "ja": "わ、わたしも、おどろかせちゃってごめんね！\n……えへへ、嫌われてなくてよかった♪", "zh": "我、我也要道歉，对不起吓到你了喔！\n……嘿嘿，幸好牠没有被讨厌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1033_sunaonaotokonoko", "source_sha256": "aee1af9682cb14411c16c6d7a612426ff44637b09ef7651b70765684e221915f", "ja": "ねえねえお姉ちゃん、\nこの犬を子分にしてるの？　すげー！", "zh": "欸欸，大姊姊，\n这只狗是你的小弟吗？好强喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "374f3b153b5abb3cc543934629af1ead20741f0be48aad958e041bb832ccc692", "ja": "こ、子分じゃないよ。お友達だよ！", "zh": "不、不是小弟啦，牠是我的朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1035_sunaonaotokonoko", "source_sha256": "dcedee28d3b9b228b5ec5cc668093d7dd249a82e29b0e2dba372a9cca5ff1506", "ja": "大きな犬と一緒に住んでるの！？\nいいなー！　いいなー！", "zh": "你跟这么大的狗一起住吗！？\n好好喔～！好羡慕喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "aba8d183c21f30475c667631a50cbcc1588442afa2335af7ec05524a96d48b2d", "ja": "そ、そうかな……えへへ。\nねえ、みんなもジュニオールなでてみる？", "zh": "很、很羡慕吗……嘿嘿。\n来，大家也要摸摸看朱尼奥尔吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1037_sunaonaotokonoko", "source_sha256": "e71349b192db84a28de7fd3646b26d7c35a6ea247963ccb5f5769c5c2241f55b", "ja": "うんっ！　なでるー！！", "zh": "嗯！我要摸──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "5652e289431d3b3133079cb863cad9684cd6da931e126b4b660325e3cac4818b", "ja": "（犬が苦手な子もいれば、好きな子もいる。\n子どもによって個性は千差万別だ……）", "zh": "（有的小孩会怕狗，有的小孩则很喜欢。\n小孩们的个性天差地别……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "c3cc384094cefbb1c92417924673c3cf2d19a40190e25b3dace4a041425afb9f", "ja": "（けれど、ひとりひとりの視点に立てば、\nきっとみんなと仲良くなれるはず……！）", "zh": "（不过，只要对每个人都设身处地，\n一定就能和他们好好相处的……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "59483e3604704c06711305b3d59d3a3bdec83e2934785ce7e8370226d8d060b8", "ja": "うしろに回り込んで……、\n弱点属性で、攻撃……で、クリア……。", "zh": "绕到后面……\n用弱点的属性攻击……这样就过关了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1041_gemagasukinako", "source_sha256": "8e2e5df5123e14dc2911e8e4c079c645c3d1b5d58b5399a9a75f80288d654245", "ja": "お姉ちゃん、ゲームうまい！　スッゲ―！\nなんでこんなことできんの……！？", "zh": "大姊姊，你好会打电动喔！好强！\n你为什么会啊……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1042_024ann", "source_sha256": "35059e744c08c94c90a8a12a3dcf7a0b101525a87fbd3755706764c2f9d6066b", "ja": "えと……。\n宇宙人、だから……？", "zh": "呃……\n因为是外星人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1043_gametoannnagasukinako", "source_sha256": "0fb04fdc05b38cf57f9dde1f092011bf4c599b6f4b02f8041b0ae82a46295a96", "ja": "ウチュージンって、スッゲー！", "zh": "外星人超强的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "4c041aa5b1c11bacfd4f9edb35e5f9e35ad47d0a86f69be8db0ec3ae15273563", "ja": "（杏奈は早くも役に入ってるみたいだ……。\n子ども達から尊敬のまなざしを浴びているぞ）", "zh": "（杏奈也马上就融入角色了呢……\n孩子们都用尊敬的眼神看着她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1045_ad", "source_sha256": "4a493652c392cbc70fe95ac3d02d963525f34068c324114d6a0e19e2dbe849ac", "ja": "さすが765プロさん！\nもう子ども達を『せーふく』しましたね！", "zh": "真不愧是765艺能啊！\n居然这么快就『征服』了小朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "1868d569693175af3aeb71b7e41dd83b81e09df0afd6a793f95c5dad15d61ac0", "ja": "ええ。出だしこそ不安でしたが、\nうまくやってくれそうです……！", "zh": "是啊，我起初还有点担心，\n但现在看来应该可以顺利进行吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1047_022ser", "source_sha256": "6c2a948ebf6434840187929e527f0982667808595710214dcc0f211faad93471", "ja": "あのね、仲良しのサインがあるんだよっ。\nみんなで、やってみましょう！", "zh": "告诉你们，有一个象征友谊的口号喔！\n一起说说看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1048_035hin", "source_sha256": "d2f122d7d4a388a4d5d916625610803b3e340b8dc149187f7c317d717cc44fcc", "ja": "それじゃ、準備はいいかい？\nせーの！", "zh": "那么，准备好了吗？\n预备──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_02_1049_022ser", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
